## 1. Commits & Architecture

The changes were structured with separate leading commits for engine surfaces followed by migrate sink fixes:

1. **Commit [`40612844`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py)** — `feat(engine): carry signature in batched append path (E1)`
   - [`Entry`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py#L805-L815) in `arrival.py` gained `signature: str | None = None`.
   - [`ArrivalLog.append_marked_many`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py#L1545-L1565) passes `sig=entry.signature` to `build_record`.
   - [`FileLedger.append`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival_file_backend.py#L290-L315) passes `signature=draft.signature` into `Entry`.
   - [`test_arrival_contract.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/tests/test_arrival_contract.py#L380-L450) verifies signature carriage, authorship verification, and byte-identical output for unsigned drafts.

2. **Commit [`fc708a09`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py)** — `feat(engine): introduce typed ArrivalTornTail exception (E2)`
   - Defined [`ArrivalTornTail(ArrivalError)`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/src/engine/arrival.py#L190-L198) in `arrival.py` (and exported in `__all__`).
   - Raised `ArrivalTornTail` in `ArrivalLog._tail_record()` when trailing bytes end mid-record.
   - Pinned by [`test_tail_record_ending_mid_record_raises_typed_arrival_torn_tail`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/engine/tests/test_arrival_gate.py#L905-L919).

3. **Commit [`8af7ef77`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py)** — `feat(migrate): WP3 sink admission, resume verification, and report verification`
   - **F1 (Admission, not replicate)**: Deleted `_drafts_to_records` and wrapper coordination in [`sidecar.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py); drafts append through `_append_drafts` calling `ledger.append(expected=head, drafts=chunk_drafts)`.
   - **F2 (Publish cannot no-op)**: In [`edit_vertex_store_clause`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py#L220-L350), verified store nodes using `ckdl.parse`, checked regex count == 1 and non-comment span; asserted `post_ast.store == Path(target_location)` and `post_ast.store_backend == BackendDecl(backend)`; verified all non-store fields using `VertexFile.__match_args__`.
   - **F3 (Resume trusts nothing it didn't derive)**: Verified genesis at ordinal 0 against [`genesis_req.custodian`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py#L850-L870) and [`genesis_req.key`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py#L860-L870); raises typed `TargetMismatchOnResumeRefused` on divergence.
   - **F4 (Refusal honesty)**: Deleted `_is_torn_tail_error`; defined [`TargetUnopenable`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/refusals.py#L260-L280) carrying `cause=exc`; caught `ArrivalTornTail` -> `TornTailRefused`; caught `StoreLost` / `ArrivalCorrupt` / `GenesisRefused` / `OSError` -> `TargetUnopenable(cause=exc)`.
   - **F5 (F2-resume-diff ratchet)**: Added test for valid chain diverging at ordinal 3 -> `TargetMismatchOnResumeRefused(ordinal=3)`.
   - **F6 (State root isolation)**: Created [`libs/migrate/tests/conftest.py`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/tests/conftest.py) with autouse `_isolate_state_root` fixture redirecting `XDG_STATE_HOME`.
   - **F7 (Ride-alongs ruled)**: Updated [`_check_inventory_equality`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py#L485-L555) to account for dropped units; updated [`verify_migration_report`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/src/migrate/sidecar.py#L560-L640) with cryptographic signature check over document minus `"signature"`, unknown key rejection, and typed report refusals; wrote report via atomic temp+fsync+replace; cleaned unused imports and dead parameters.

4. **Commit [`70a6dbb2`](file:///Users/kaygee/Code/loops-wt/s4-wp3/libs/migrate/tests/test_sidecar.py)** — `test(migrate): use body_of_fact_row for divergent draft in resume test`

